<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Usage</h2>

<p>This reflects usage for the whole app across all users. TTS/STT usage is not included.</p>

<%= form_tag admin_completions_path, method: :get do %>
  <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
    <%= date_field_tag :start_date, params[:start_date], class: "" %>
    <%= date_field_tag :end_date, params[:end_date], class: "" %>
    <%= submit_tag "Filter by Date Range", class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%= render partial: "usage_table", locals: { usage_data: @usage_data } %>
<hr class="my-5 dark:border-stone-700">
<p><i>Notes:</i></p>
<p><sup>*</sup> Tokens are recorded according to the native tokenizer of each model, so the total across different models is not very meaningful.</p>
<p><sup>**</sup> Note: Actual cost is only recorded when OpenRouter is used.</p>
